div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Marcar: No compre cristales, pulseras de cuentas, figuras de pixiu ni objetos por el estilo para \"cambiar la suerte\", \"atraer dinero\" o \"nutrirse\""},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Hecho"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Por hacer"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Guardar"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Compartir consejo"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Ocultar detalles"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Coste"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["0 yuanes. Lo único que hay que hacer es no contar el \"cambiar la suerte\" o el \"nutrirse\" entre las razones de compra. Lo difícil es no seguir la corriente cuando todos alrededor lo llevan puesto y dicen que funciona."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Beneficio"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["El clásico experimento de aula muestra que todo el mundo recibía el mismo \"análisis personal\" vago y, aun así, casi todos lo encontraban muy acertado; a eso se le llama efecto Barnum, y explica de dónde sale la sensación de \"desde que lo llevo, todo va mejor\". La conclusión de aquel autor: que la descripción se acepte no demuestra que sea correcta. Caso oficial: la Administración Estatal de Regulación del Mercado publicó el 4 de junio de 2026 un lote de casos típicos de \"limpieza de fraudes\" en los mercados de artesanía tradicional. Entre ellos, una joyería de Sihui, en Guangdong, que en sus ventas en directo inventaba el material de las piezas y atribuía a los productos efectos como \"prevenir y tratar el reumatismo, reforzar la inmunidad, mejorar el sueño y desobstruir los vasos sanguíneos\", engañando al público con guiones teatrales; infringe el artículo 9, primer párrafo, de la Ley contra la Competencia Desleal (norma nacional)"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Fuentes originales"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Forer BR (1949). The fallacy of personal validation: A classroom demonstration of gullibility. Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1037/h0059240","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1037/h0059240"]},"；国家市场监督管理总局 (2026). 市场监管总局公布一批传统工艺市场「打假清源」典型案例. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.samr.gov.cn/xw/zj/art/2026/art_1529399cfe874b8780c4496eb0158020.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.samr.gov.cn/xw/zj/art/2026/art_1529399cfe874b8780c4496eb0158020.html"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1037/h0059240","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Abrir fuente"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Nota del autor"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["Esta entrada dice una sola cosa: sus efectos no se pueden verificar ni medir como capacidad de predicción. No juzga ninguna creencia ni costumbre, y no va contra regalarlo, guardarlo de recuerdo o dejarlo de herencia. Conviene separar dos planos: los efectos que declara el vendedor tienen norma escrita que los prohíbe, y por ellos se puede reclamar; el \"cambiar la suerte\" no tiene ningún estudio y, además, es imposible demostrar que sea falso, así que solo cabe contenerlo con el propio presupuesto. Antes de comprarlo, mírelo como una joya cualquiera y pregúntese: \"si no cambiara absolutamente nada, ¿pagaría igual este precio?\". Cómo comprobar el material y los certificados, y por qué como inversión no compensa: sección 5, entradas 33 y 34 (las pulseras y los relojes de lujo se contabilizan por el dinero gastado; las gemas piden un informe CMA). Pagar por adivinar la suerte: entrada 15 de esta sección (adivinos, tarot y horóscopos)."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Mi nota"]},{"ta